{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Cryptage \u2014 A Roguelite of Magic and Chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Cryptage</i>, you are a fearless wizard exploring a dark crypt filled with dangerous monsters. It\u2019s a fast-paced real-time action roguelite with insane spells and addictive progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374600/extras/output-onlinegiftools__1_.gif?t=1744215367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Real-Time Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face wave after wave of enemies! With each new wave, the challenge grows \u2014 and you get to level up your powers with unique cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf <strong>Powerful Card System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of every wave, choose a card that grants special abilities. Got a duplicate? It evolves \u2014 boosting damage, speed, or unlocking new effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Customize Your Wizard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy unique staffs, unlock stylish skins, and shape your wizard your way. Mix looks with power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long can you survive? Test your reflexes, builds, and creativity in an endless fight against bosses and monster swarms.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374600?t=1744215367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744215367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374600/d22d5f71ad5f3ce4f052b87dccbad741702bbbec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744215367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374600/d22d5f71ad5f3ce4f052b87dccbad741702bbbec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744215367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3460600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Cryptage \u2014 A Roguelite of Magic and Chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Cryptage</i>, you are a fearless wizard exploring a dark crypt filled with dangerous monsters. It\u2019s a fast-paced real-time action roguelite with insane spells and addictive progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374600/extras/output-onlinegiftools__1_.gif?t=1744215367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Real-Time Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face wave after wave of enemies! With each new wave, the challenge grows \u2014 and you get to level up your powers with unique cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf <strong>Powerful Card System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of every wave, choose a card that grants special abilities. Got a duplicate? It evolves \u2014 boosting damage, speed, or unlocking new effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Customize Your Wizard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy unique staffs, unlock stylish skins, and shape your wizard your way. Mix looks with power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long can you survive? Test your reflexes, builds, and creativity in an endless fight against bosses and monster swarms.</p>","developers":["MoonStone Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co